[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# Step 2: Navigate to the project directory.[m
[32m+[m[32mcd <YOUR_PROJECT_NAME>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# Step 3: Install the necessary dependencies.[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm i[m
