[32m+[m[32m- Click the "Edit" button (pencil icon) at the top right of the file view.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Make your changes and commit the changes.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Use GitHub Codespaces**[m
[32m+[m
