[32m+[m[32m- Click on the "Code" button (green button) near the top right.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Select the "Codespaces" tab.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Click on "New codespace" to launch a new Codespace environment.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Edit files directly within the Codespace and commit and push your changes once you're done.[m
